@startuml
title UC-01 Ask Course-Related Questions (analysis sequence)
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
actor Student
boundary AssistantInterface
control QuestionAnswerer
entity Course
entity CourseMaterial
entity Question
entity Answer

Student -> AssistantInterface : 1 selects a course
AssistantInterface -> QuestionAnswerer : 2.1 passes on the chosen course
QuestionAnswerer -> Student : 2.2 checks the student is enrolled in the course
QuestionAnswerer -> AssistantInterface : 2.3 confirms the selected course
AssistantInterface -> Student : 2.4 shows the course and invites a question
Student -> AssistantInterface : 3 submits a question about the course
AssistantInterface -> QuestionAnswerer : 4.1 passes on the question
QuestionAnswerer -> Question : 4.2 records the question for the course
QuestionAnswerer -> Course : 4.3 asks for material relevant to the question
Course -> CourseMaterial : 4.4 looks up its matching material
alt material supports an answer
  QuestionAnswerer -> Answer : 4.5 forms an answer from the material, noting its source
  QuestionAnswerer -> AssistantInterface : 4.6 hands over the answer and its source
  AssistantInterface -> Student : 4.7 shows the answer with its source reference
  Student -> AssistantInterface : 5 asks to examine the supporting material
  AssistantInterface -> QuestionAnswerer : 6.1 passes on the request
  QuestionAnswerer -> Answer : 6.2 asks for the source the answer is based on
  QuestionAnswerer -> AssistantInterface : 6.3 hands over the located material
  AssistantInterface -> Student : 6.4 shows the source and confirms it was located
else A1 material does not support an answer
  QuestionAnswerer -> AssistantInterface : A1.1 reports that the material is insufficient
  AssistantInterface -> Student : A1.2 explains that no answer is supported
end
@enduml
